la may be dr manhattan agent  pedi who is definitely lube man might be  out there in the world  dan dryberg who is night owl too is  still in federal custody  he knows the truth lori blake's still  out there  and perhaps has a great new relationship  with mirror guy  aka looking glass but it has come to an  end the main story in tulsa for right  now  has concluded the story of dr manhattan  being created in gila flats when john  osterman was tore apart at the atomic  level  and then reassembled himself to become a  blue god there's an ending to that  and i hope that there's more watchmen to  come but we'll wait and see how that  goes  i'm gonna leave the video there let me  know in the comments what your favorite  moments were  i'm gonna go listen to the official  podcast and read all the interviews and  then i'll probably come back with a deep  dive  in the next couple of days i enjoyed  this finale it answered most of the  questions i wanted answered  i think that a lot of people probably  liked it but there will be a lot of  people who don't so let me know what you  think  what would you have liked to seem  different how are you feeling about a  season two now  and what do you think happened when  angela put her foot  on top of that water in the pool it was  important for later please like this  video if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already thanks for watching guys  thanks for watching  watchmen with me this season i'll talk  to you soon

